OL,3,GNEWSAResidents raise #450,000 to bring
OL,4,Aback village pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village pub that closed more than two
OL,7,Fyears ago is on the road to reopening
OL,8,Fafter local people raised #450,000 to
OL,9,Fhelp buy it.
OL,11,FThe Red Lion in Upper Basildon,
OL,12,FBerkshire, is now due to open its doors
OL,13,Ffor a community clean-up and it is
OL,14,Fhoped it will reopen fully next spring.
OL,16,FNew owners John Hunter and Annabel
OL,17,FCochrane, who also run the Red Lion in
OL,18,Fneighbouring Blewbury, said contracts
OL,19,Fhad been exchanged with the previous
OL,20,Fowners, Stonegate Pub Company.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
